  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Total work done by the gas from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>Area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></math></p><p>Work done during the process&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>DE</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>600</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1350</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p>Work done during the process&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>EF</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>900</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>DEF</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>DE</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>EF</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>450</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
